messages.text:
Kay: Great!
You are like a professional!{be01}
Ali: How did you know?

Ohhh... I knew it was difficult
to fight with Pokémon as well as{be00}
the professionals do.

Pokémon do
what I cannot do.{be01}
You know how wonderful this is,
don't you?{be01}

Even existing sports shine
with new appeal{be00}
when they team up with Pokémon!
